          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is LLM SEO?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "LLM SEO is the process of structuring brand, website, and content signals so large language models can understand, trust, and potentially reference your business inside AI-generated answers. It focuses on entity clarity, topical authority, answer-ready content, and citation readiness."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How is LLM SEO different from traditional SEO?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Traditional SEO focuses on ranking pages in search engine results. LLM SEO focuses on helping AI systems understand and include your brand inside conversational answers, summaries, and recommendations. Both work best together because AI visibility still depends on crawlable content, authority, relevance, and trust."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How can a brand get cited in AI answers?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "A brand can improve its chances of being cited in AI answers by creating clear service pages, building topical authority, using structured data, maintaining consistent entity information, publishing credible resources, and earning trustworthy mentions across the web. No agency can guarantee AI citations, but the right structure improves eligibility."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Can LLM SEO work with AEO, GEO, and traditional SEO?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. LLM SEO works best when combined with AEO, GEO, and traditional SEO. SEO improves crawlability and search authority, AEO improves answer extraction, GEO improves generative search visibility, and LLM SEO helps AI systems interpret and recommend the brand more accurately."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Does LLM SEO improve ROI?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "LLM SEO can support ROI by improving brand visibility during high-intent research journeys where users ask AI tools for vendor recommendations, comparisons, and explanations. The impact depends on industry competition, authority signals, content quality, and how well the website supports conversion after discovery."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
